# The markers the engine draws (reference/components/list.md#drawn-markers): circle, square and checkbox. Page of
# 595 × 300 with margins of 40: page area of 515 × 220 from (40, 40). Lines of 12 (Size 10).
#
# The indent of the lists is their left Padding of 30, declared in Styles. Each marker is a square centered on the
# capitals of the first line of its item and followed by a space: as tall as the capitals in a checkbox, and half of
# them in a circle and a square. tasks has a checked item and one that is not. md is a Markdown with a list of tasks,
# which needs no Bullet markers, and a bulleted list whose two levels take circle and square from Bullet markers.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 595
		Height: 300
		Margin: 40
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: List
			Box:
				Padding: 0 0 0 30
	Section:
		List:
			Id: levels
			Marker: circle
			List item:
				Id: l1
				Text: Cobertura básica
				List:
					Id: sub
					Marker: square
					List item:
						Id: s1
						Text: Daños propios
		List:
			Id: tasks
			Marker: checkbox
			List item:
				Id: t1
				Checked: true
				Text: DNI del tomador
			List item:
				Id: t2
				Typography:
					Color: #B00020
				Text: Justificante de pago
		Markdown:
			Id: md
			Bullet markers: circle square
			Content >>
				- [x] Firmado
				- [ ] **Pagado**

				Pendiente:

				- Uno
				  - Dos
